      "id": "VoxelContent",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6e1d7ecce995651407009eb2a81dddf78e17ab239c41693ce53fb4dfc42bdabc",
      "text": "必须定义 loader 或 metadata 之一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VoxelContent",
      "field": "exceptions/1/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ebe4b6ee4429a8607f4e33269025b11bcc09ea3094ea5da48f4ab4c31dd21ebb",
      "text": "metadata 必须为 TypedArray 数组。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VoxelPrimitive#allTilesLoaded",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:20e048ba1df6565d771bd8e93870ca5eccd4bdeca9e14db8834f695a701788bf",
      "text": "当前帧中全部满足屏幕空间误差要求的瓦片加载完成时触发，表示当前视图下体素图元已完全加载。\n<p>\n在场景完成渲染后的帧末触发。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "VoxelPrimitive#boundingSphere",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:bf5146159cbbd7cd5e0e160e675a60cf104b03e77a6969db3fb83058b3b277d9",
      "text": "获取包围球。"
    },
