    {
      "id": "VoxelPrimitive#customShader",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ac949c8ec21fa8d72515d1e28f04ba7af83dce053c9120eb87bc536ca464c434",
      "text": "获取或设置自定义着色器。为 undefined 时，尝试按元数据类型构建默认着色器；失败时使用 {@link VoxelPrimitive.DefaultCustomShader}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VoxelPrimitive#debugDraw",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0455c5afde8201346643ffaaf0a5b6cb28929652eda43bb9fac8f80920a10a89",
      "text": "获取或设置是否渲染调试可视化。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VoxelPrimitive#depthTest",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8eed868b53b19dcf4d2c506aa2014f60dd4482dd715bced7e7c46666f01ff23d",
      "text": "获取或设置渲染时是否执行深度测试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VoxelPrimitive#destroy",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b385add820d9f47d540aad147f1cdf85f05e8c6cb81c3928a59c8fd5f7bd8d69",
      "text": "销毁此对象持有的 WebGL 资源。显式销毁可确定地释放 WebGL 资源，而不依赖垃圾回收器回收此对象。<br /><br />对象销毁后不应再使用；调用除 <code>isDestroyed</code> 以外的任何函数都会抛出 {@link DeveloperError}。因此，应像示例中那样将返回值（<code>undefined</code>）赋给该对象变量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VoxelPrimitive#dimensions",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5c51fdfb25be1011adaab8e31c39f352d20101bfab16be6b55757ce5be3d07a3",
      "text": "获取每个体素瓦片在 Z 向上朝向下的尺寸，即各轴体素数量，不含填充体素。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VoxelPrimitive#disableUpdate",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:90fb3e84a8eae75ea9bb5e7d2026db84effdf9599f969eff794e87b5307e803e",
      "text": "获取或设置视图变化时是否禁止更新图元。"
